WEBVTT

00:00:03.238 --> 00:00:06.247
Content uses the library through media fields.

00:00:06.247 --> 00:00:11.108
This is the form that creates an Article, and its Banner Image field is empty.

00:00:11.607 --> 00:00:16.717
Add media opens the media picker, which shows the same library in a dialog.

00:00:17.178 --> 00:00:19.690
Select a file and confirm the choice.

00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:21.677
The field shows a thumbnail.

00:00:21.677 --> 00:00:25.768
When you save, the content item stores the path of the file, not

00:00:25.768 --> 00:00:26.878
a copy of it.

00:00:27.339 --> 00:00:31.494
On the site, the About page uses this same file in its Banner Image field.

00:00:31.494 --> 00:00:35.753
The theme requests the image through the banner profile, so the header shows

00:00:35.753 --> 00:00:37.519
it cropped to a wide banner.

